  "summary": {
    "es": "El retador debía salir de un torneo en Nueva York en 1889, pero sus dos ganadores, Chigorin y Max Weiss, no quisieron desafiar a Steinitz. El tercero, el húngaro Isidor Gunsberg, sí aceptó, y llegó a ir adelante y a quedar a una sola victoria del campeón. Steinitz ganó la partida 18 y cerró el match 10½ a 8½, con seis victorias contra cuatro.",
    "en": "The challenger was supposed to come out of a New York tournament in 1889, but its two winners, Chigorin and Max Weiss, declined to challenge Steinitz. The third-placed Hungarian, Isidor Gunsberg, accepted, led early and later stayed within a single win of the champion. Steinitz won game 18 and closed the match 10½–8½, with six wins to four."
  },
